<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πωλικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of foals, fillies</i>, or
				<i>young horses</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
			ἀπήνη</span> a chariot <i>drawn by young horses</i> or
			(generally) <i>by horses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				802
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἄντυγες, ὄχημα, ζυγά,
				ὄχος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				567
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				621
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IA</u>
				619
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				623
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. διώγματα</span> pursuit
				<i>in a chariot drawn by young horses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				992
			</span></i>; in races, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τέθριππον</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλεον τέθριππον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).549
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππων
				πωλικῷ ζεύγει</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.2311.52
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνωρὶς π</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				42(1).101.46
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.380b
			</span></i> (Samos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα
				π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42(1).101.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of any young animal</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κὸν ζεῦγος
				βοῶν</span> a team of <i>young</i> oxen, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.Com.
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> poet.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἑδώλια</span>
			<i>the girls</i>' apartments, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				454
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
